<p>I'm sort of on the fence about this, mostly because of the REASONING between the different write-ups. I can really only think of three reasons: 1) the doc was under some sort of mental or memetic compulsion from the SCP; 2) the doc thought it was &quot;beneficial&quot; and figured that writing up something relatively passive and genteel would maybe make folks think it was okay to use as a euthanasia plant; or 3) the Foundation wants to make sure nobody thinks it's a good idea to get around this thing willingly.</p>
