<p>The fact the two versions are identical is kind of the point to me.</p>
<p>Everyone knows what the SCP does. The difference is one writer goes &quot;The plant gets people to come to it so they can die painlessly, ain't it great, heh feel free to come feed yourself to it, it's the best form of suicide around&quot;; while the other goes &quot;This is a plant that makes people feed themselves to it. Keep the susceptible individuals away&quot;.</p>
<p>The facts are the same, it's the interpretation that's different.</p>

